// The six KPIs of the Carrier Scorecard as DAX measures on the table 'shipments'
// (loaded from data/shipments_2025_clean.csv). The fallback if the agent cannot create them:
// in Power BI Desktop, Modeling, New measure, paste one at a time.
// on_time, transit_days and damaged are empty where they do not apply: COUNT and AVERAGE skip
// empty cells, so they are never treated as 0.

Shipments = COUNTROWS ( shipments )

Known result = COUNT ( shipments[on_time] )

On time % = DIVIDE ( SUM ( shipments[on_time] ), COUNT ( shipments[on_time] ) )            // format 0.0%

Transit days = AVERAGE ( shipments[transit_days] )                                           // format 0.00

Cost per shipment € = AVERAGE ( shipments[cost_eur] )                                        // format 0.00

Damaged % = DIVIDE ( SUM ( shipments[damaged] ), COUNT ( shipments[damaged] ) )             // format 0.0%
